{
  "date_key": "2026-10-30",
  "date_cn": "2026年10月30日",
  "day_cn": "周五",
  "english": "<div style=\"background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #c7dcff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0d47a1;margin-bottom:8px\">🎧 双人地道对话发音</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#566;margin-bottom:9px\">A 男声 · B 女声 · 自然语速</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" style=\"width:100%\"><source src=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-10-30-dialogue.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-10-30-dialogue.wav\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">▶ 播放或下载今日对话音频</a></div></div><div style=\"background:#e8f0fe;border-left:4px solid #1a73e8;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:15px\">【今日主题】</strong><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-weight:400;color:#1a73e8\">压力与焦虑（Stress, Burnout, Anxiety Spirals）</span></div>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #0d47a1;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#0d47a1;font-size:15px\">【英文原文】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Hey, you look completely <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">wiped out</span>. Are you holding up okay?</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Barely. Honestly, I&#x27;m feeling a bit <strong>frayed at the edges</strong> lately. Between the new product launch and managing the junior developers, I&#x27;ve been <strong>running around like a blue-arsed fly</strong> all week. I haven&#x27;t even had time to grab a proper lunch.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I warned you not to <strong>spread yourself too thin</strong> this quarter. You can&#x27;t just say yes to every single request that lands in your inbox.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I know, I know. But I completely <strong>went into a tailspin</strong> on Tuesday when the main server crashed right before the demo. I was practically <strong>climbing the walls</strong> at 2 AM waiting for the overseas IT guys to patch it. The anxiety was unreal.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Look, I get it, but you can&#x27;t keep letting every little operational hiccup make you <strong>work yourself into a lather</strong>. Whenever something goes wrong, you just sit at your desk and <strong>stew in your own juices</strong> instead of taking a step back to breathe.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">It&#x27;s hard to stay calm when the regional director is <strong>having kittens</strong> over the Q4 marketing budget. During yesterday&#x27;s board meeting, I just had to <strong>white-knuckle it</strong> through the financial review while he aggressively interrogated my team. I thought I was going to pass out.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Mate, if you don&#x27;t take a proper weekend off soon, you&#x27;re just going to keep <strong>chasing your tail</strong> without getting any actual productive work done. You really need to <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">pull the plug</span> for a couple of days before you completely burn out.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">You&#x27;re right. I think I&#x27;ll mute my notifications this weekend.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #1b5e20;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1b5e20;font-size:15px\">【中文翻译】</strong></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：嘿，你看起来完全<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">累瘫了</span>。你还撑得住吗？（Hey, you look completely wiped out. Are you holding up okay?）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：勉强吧。说实话，我最近感觉自己有点<strong>心力交瘁/濒临崩溃</strong>。（Barely. Honestly, I&#x27;m feeling a bit frayed at the edges lately.）在负责新产品发布和管理初级开发人员之间，我这整整一周都<strong>像无头苍蝇一样忙得团团转</strong>。（Between the new product launch and managing the junior developers, I&#x27;ve been running around like a blue-arsed fly all week.）我甚至连好好吃顿午饭的时间都没有。（I haven&#x27;t even had time to grab a proper lunch.）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：我早就警告过你，这个季度别<strong>把精力分散得太开/大包大揽</strong>。（I warned you not to spread yourself too thin this quarter.）你不能对发到你邮箱里的每一个请求都来者不拒。（You can&#x27;t just say yes to every single request that lands in your inbox.）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：我知道，我知道。但是周二演示前主服务器崩溃的时候，我整个人完全<strong>陷入了焦虑的恶性循环/情绪失控</strong>。（I know, I know. But I completely went into a tailspin on Tuesday when the main server crashed right before the demo.）凌晨两点等着海外IT团队打补丁时，我简直<strong>急得像热锅上的蚂蚁/抓狂</strong>。（I was practically climbing the walls at 2 AM waiting for the overseas IT guys to patch it.）那种焦虑感太不真实了。（The anxiety was unreal.）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：听着，我能理解，但你不能总让每一个小小的运营状况都让你<strong>激动焦虑、自寻烦恼</strong>。（Look, I get it, but you can&#x27;t keep letting every little operational hiccup make you work yourself into a lather.）每当出了岔子，你只是坐在办公桌前<strong>独自生闷气/深陷焦虑中内耗</strong>，而不是退一步深呼吸。（Whenever something goes wrong, you just sit at your desk and stew in your own juices instead of taking a step back to breathe.）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：当区域总监因为第四季度营销预算<strong>大发雷霆/急得跳脚</strong>时，真的很难保持冷静。（It&#x27;s hard to stay calm when the regional director is having kittens over the Q4 marketing budget.）在昨天的董事会上，当他咄咄逼人地盘问我的团队时，我只能<strong>咬紧牙关硬挺过去</strong>。（During yesterday&#x27;s board meeting, I just had to white-knuckle it through the financial review while he aggressively interrogated my team.）我当时以为自己都要晕倒了。（I thought I was going to pass out.）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：伙计，如果你不赶紧好好休个周末，你只会继续<strong>瞎忙活/原地打转</strong>，做不出任何实质性的工作成果。（Mate, if you don&#x27;t take a proper weekend off soon, you&#x27;re just going to keep chasing your tail without getting any actual productive work done.）在彻底职业倦怠之前，你真的需要<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">彻底抛开工作</span>休息几天。（You really need to pull the plug for a couple of days before you completely burn out.）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：你说得对。我想我这个周末会把通知静音。（You&#x27;re right. I think I&#x27;ll mute my notifications this weekend.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e5f5;border-left:4px solid #4a148c;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#4a148c;font-size:15px\">【本日表达列表】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">01.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>frayed at the edges</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 心力交瘁；由于压力过大而显露出疲态或崩溃的迹象</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述某人因长期压力、劳累而即将失去耐性或心理防线脆弱的状态。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">02.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>run around like a blue-arsed fly</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 像无头苍蝇一样忙得团团转；极其忙乱</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国 / 澳大利亚 / 新西兰</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 生动形容极度忙碌、东奔西跑但往往缺乏条理的焦躁状态（非常口语化）。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">03.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>spread oneself too thin</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 大包大揽；把精力分散在太多事情上导致应接不暇</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 常用于职场或生活中警告某人不要承担过多责任，以免过度劳累且什么都做不好。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">04.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>go into a tailspin</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 迅速陷入混乱、失控或极度焦虑的状态</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国通用 / 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 原指飞机螺旋坠落，现常用于描述因突发事件导致情绪、心理或局势急转直下，失去控制。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">05.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>climbing the walls</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 极其焦虑、抓狂或烦躁不安</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容在等待某事或处于极大压力下时，那种无法安坐、极度焦躁的情绪状态。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">06.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>work oneself into a lather</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 使自己极度激动、焦虑或生气</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 指为了通常不值得的事情而让自己陷入过度的焦虑、愤怒或激动之中（lather原指马出的白汗或肥皂沫）。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">07.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>stew in one&#x27;s own juices</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 独自生闷气；在自己的焦虑或愤怒中煎熬内耗</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 指某人陷入负面情绪（如压力、愤怒、焦虑）且无人安抚，只能自己在其中折磨自己。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">08.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>have kittens</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 极度担忧、惊慌失措或大发雷霆</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国 / 澳大利亚</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 英式口语，夸张地形容某人因为某件突发坏事而非常焦急或生气（类似于生生吓出一窝小猫）。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">09.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>white-knuckle it</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 咬紧牙关熬过去；在极度紧张或恐惧中死撑</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国通用 / 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 来源于因过度用力抓紧某物而指关节泛白，指在巨大压力、焦虑或戒断反应下强忍着撑过难关。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">10.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>chase one&#x27;s tail</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 白费力气；瞎忙活但毫无进展</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 比喻像狗追着自己的尾巴咬一样，虽然非常忙碌、充满压力，但实际上没有解决任何问题。</span></td></tr></table>",
  "research": "<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9eef2;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 22px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00838f,#26c6da);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin:-20px -22px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.6px\">🎯 今日研究主线</div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#546e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧭 选题方向：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Structural teacher vulnerability and institutional discourse</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#6a1b9a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧷 对应草稿：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">10.1080/09518398.2026.2736694</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#1565c0;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🔎 检索主题：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">teacher structural vulnerability institutional discourse bilingual education emotional labor</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#8e24aa;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🪄 为什么是它：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">延伸已发表的教师结构性脆弱研究，而不是泛泛推荐教师压力或倦怠文献。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">✍️ 今天重点：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">寻找能把个人遭遇转化为制度机制的概念或方法，尤其关注责任、保护、可信度与教师声音。</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:5px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#555;font-size:13px;padding-left:96px\">（今天没有论文同时通过启发性、主线相关性与质量门槛。宁缺毋滥，明天再看。）</p>\n</div>",
  "mentor": "<p style=\"margin:6px 0;color:#555;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8\">（今日暂无可精读的论文，请稍后查看）</p>",
  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://rfa.org/english/china/2026/10/28/china-taiwan-sun-yat-sen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国利用台湾对孙中山的尊崇以推动“统一”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China leverages Taiwan’s reverence for Sun Yat-sen to promote ‘reunification’</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国大陆正巧妙地利用台湾社会对孙中山先生的敬仰，将其作为文化纽带，旨在潜移默化地促进两岸统一的政治目标，此举反映了北京对台策略的软硬兼施。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">自由亚洲电台</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/10/29/china-loves-to-rank-its-cities-the-government-wants-it-to-stop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国政府希望停止城市排名热潮</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China loves to rank its cities. The government wants it to stop</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国各地长期盛行的城市排名风气，涵盖经济、宜居性等多个维度，如今正受到中央政府的干预，此举可能旨在避免不必要的竞争和地方政府的数据粉饰，引导城市发展回归理性。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3372643/chinese-scientists-dissatisfied-jobs-optimistic-about-future-survey-says\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">调查显示中国科学家对工作不满但对未来乐观</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Chinese scientists dissatisfied with jobs but optimistic about future, survey says</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一项最新调查揭示，尽管中国科学家普遍对其当前工作状况存在不满情绪，但在展望未来时，他们依然保持着积极乐观的态度，这为中国科技发展的人才现状提供了复杂图景。（独立视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/10/30/2003866854\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国陆军概述2027年台海冲突可能部署方案</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">US Army outlines Pacific deployments for possible 2027 China-Taiwan conflict</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国陆军公布了其在太平洋地区针对2027年可能发生的中国与台湾冲突的兵力部署预案，此举旨在展现美军在该区域的威慑力和快速反应能力，凸显地区紧张局势。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq5ynw94k7kzo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">习近平强调“党纪”，中国政治会议清洗人数创纪录</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Record number of purges as Xi emphasises &#x27;party discipline&#x27; at China political gathering</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在近期举行的中国重要政治会议上，国家主席习近平强调了“党纪”的重要性，导致被清洗的官员人数创下历史新高，这表明中共正持续强化内部控制和反腐力度。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/10/29/brad-cooper-briefs-trump-iran-naval-blockade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国中东最高指挥官向特朗普汇报伊朗封锁情况</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Top U.S. Middle East commander briefs Trump on Iran blockade</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国中东地区最高军事指挥官向美国前总统特朗普汇报了有关伊朗封锁行动的详细情况，此举可能涉及地区安全战略和潜在的军事应对方案，凸显了中东地缘政治的复杂性。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/10/29/1230906945/patrick-stewart-dead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">影星帕特里克·斯图尔特去世，享年86岁，曾主演《星际迷航》和《X战警》</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Patrick Stewart, a perceptive patriarch in &#x27;Star Trek&#x27; and &#x27;X-Men,&#x27; dies at 86</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国著名演员帕特里克·斯图尔特于86岁高龄辞世，他因在《星际迷航》中饰演皮卡德舰长及在《X战警》系列中饰演X教授而享誉全球，其去世标志着一位标志性银幕人物的谢幕，令影迷深感惋惜。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/newsletters/2026/10/kids-halloween-costumes-confuse-adults/689212/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">一场无伤大雅的万圣节小反叛</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">A Harmless Act of Halloween Rebellion</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">文章探讨了万圣节期间一些看似出格实则无伤大雅的行为，这些行为反映了人们在特定节日氛围下寻求短暂释放与打破常规的心理，为社会观察提供了一个有趣的视角。（文化评论）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/29/houthis-yemen-war-saudi-arabia-red-sea-shipping-threat-iran/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">胡塞武装的威胁究竟有多大？</a><d