ine train station</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">俄罗斯对乌克兰一处火车站发动了“骇人听闻”的无人机袭击，导致至少14名平民丧生。此次袭击加剧了乌克兰境内的人道危机，也再次凸显了俄乌冲突中平民面临的巨大风险。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-10-30/shopfront-arts-co-op-50-years-act-a-thon-paul-capsis/107314116\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">青年剧团筹款逾6.8万美元，延续50年艺术传承</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Youth theatre raises more than $68k to carry forward 50-year legacy</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一个青年剧团通过积极募捐，成功筹集了超过6.8万美元，旨在延续其长达半个世纪的艺术传承与社区服务。这笔资金将帮助剧团继续为当地年轻人提供艺术教育和表演平台，确保其文化遗产得以延续。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/entertainment/patrick-stewart-shakespearean-actor-turned-star-trek-and-x-men-star-dies-at-86/article71642350.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">《星际迷航》“皮卡德舰长”、《X战警》“X教授”扮演者帕特里克·斯图尔特去世，享年86岁</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Patrick Stewart, Shakespearean actor turned &#x27;Star Trek&#x27; and &#x27;X-Men&#x27; star, dies at 86</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国著名莎士比亚戏剧演员、科幻影视巨星帕特里克·斯图尔特爵士因其在《星际迷航》和《X战警》系列中的标志性角色广受全球观众喜爱，他的逝世标志着演艺界一位巨匠的陨落，引发广泛关注。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/10/30/a-century-of-sporting-ties-india-and-nz-face-off-in-the-globes-great-codes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">体育情谊百年：印度与新西兰在全球顶级赛事中对决</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">A century of sporting ties: India and NZ face off in the globe’s great codes</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">印度和新西兰两国在体育领域拥有长达一个世纪的深厚联系与激烈对抗，本文探讨两国如何在板球、橄榄球等全球主要体育项目中建立的独特竞争与友谊，展示体育如何超越国界，成为文化交流的桥梁。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/emergencies_local/2236948/tracer-round-fired-by-machine-gun-believed-to-have-sparked-large-waiouru-scrub-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">瓦伊乌鲁灌木丛大火疑因机关枪发射曳光弹引起</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Tracer round fired by machine gun believed to have sparked large Waiouru scrub fire</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰瓦伊乌鲁军事训练区发生的大规模灌木丛火灾，调查人员初步认为是由机关枪发射的曳光弹意外引燃。这起事件揭示了军事演习中潜在的安全风险，并对生态环境造成影响。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/politics/361052560/nz-election-2026-live-updates-politics-campaign-news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">“不可谈判”：新西兰总理拉克森拒绝西摩担任财政部长的提议</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">‘Non-negotiable’: Luxon shuts down Seymour’s bid for finance minister</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰总理克里斯托弗·拉克森明确拒绝了行动党领袖大卫·西摩关于担任财政部长的要求，强调该职位“不可谈判”。此举凸显了执政联盟内部的权力动态与潜在分歧，对未来政策走向有重要影响。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/editorial/2026/10/29/patrick-stewart-star-trek-captain-picard-and-x-men-actor-dies-at-86?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">《星际迷航》“皮卡德舰长”、《X战警》“X教授”扮演者帕特里克·斯图尔特去世，享年86岁</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Patrick Stewart, ‘Star Trek’ Captain Picard and ‘X-Men’ actor, dies at 86</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国著名演员帕特里克·斯图尔特爵士因其在经典科幻系列《星际迷航》中饰演的皮卡德舰长和在《X战警》系列中饰演的X教授而闻名全球，他的逝世是电影界的一大损失，引发影迷广泛悼念。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw78prj801pvo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">埃塞俄比亚在提格雷冲突中购入俄罗斯战斗机和防空系统</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Ethiopia acquires Russian fighter jets and air defence systems amid war in Tigray</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在提格雷地区持续冲突的背景下，埃塞俄比亚已从俄罗斯购买了战斗机和先进防空系统。此举可能进一步加剧地区紧张局势，改变军事力量平衡，并引发国际社会对埃塞俄俄比亚人道危机的关注。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckdd8qdl9e0eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">以色列反对派指责内塔尼亚胡试图“非法化”选举</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Israeli opposition accuses Netanyahu of trying to &#x27;delegitimise&#x27; election</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">以色列反对派领导人甘茨指责现任总理内塔尼亚胡在面临潜在的腐败指控和支持率下滑之际，试图通过攻击选举制度来动摇公众对选举结果的信任，引发政治动荡。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3x2w4109pj8o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">巴西前总统博索纳罗之子弗拉维奥·博索纳罗在选举失利后自称“巴西领导人”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Flávio Bolsonaro calls himself &#x27;leader of Brazil&#x27; after election loss</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在巴西总统选举中，现任总统博索纳罗未能连任，其子弗拉维奥·博索纳罗在社交媒体上发布争议言论，自称是“巴西领导人”，此举被视为其家族拒绝接受选举结果的信号，加剧了政治紧张局势。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
